<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan discount rate falls to 18 pct.</title>
<headline>Moldovan discount rate falls to 18 pct.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moldova's National Bank cut its official discount rate to 18 percent from the 19 percent annual in force since May 19, the National Bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>The rate was set at a credit funds auction where nine banks acquired three-month funds totalling 7.53 million lei ($1.83 million).</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
